    "description": "\n [accent[]]Admin Button 2[[]]  - A mod with lots of features for multiplayer and singleplayer games\n\n [accent[]]Control panel[[]]: Control panel with customizable buttons\n\n [accent[]]Chat enhancements[[]]: You can customize how your chat messages look so that you can stand out\n\n [accent[]]Wave viewer[[]]: Waves can be viewed while playing\n\n [accent[]]Image generator[[]]: Generating schematics with images has never been easier\n\n [accent[]]AutoFill[[]]: A very customizable way to automatically fill buildings with items\n\n [accent[]]Player controller[[]]: Automatically control your unit\n\n [accent[]]Turret range[[]]: Range of turrets can be viewed\n\n [accent[]]And more[[]]: Lots of other features\n",
